Prompt: edit_chapter.j2
Service Step: EDIT_CHAPTER (Chapter Editing)
Brief Description: Local editing of draft based on stage cards. The editing phase
          is responsible for cleaning language, fixing known issues,
          adjusting word count and rhythm, but must not replan the chapter.
Upstream Input:
  - draft_text: Current chapter body text
  - stage_cards.source: ChapterSourceSlice, containing boundary-constrained source projection
  - stage_cards: contract / bridge / plan / style / memory / repair derived cards
  - chapter_repair_report / word_count_warning / word_count_restructure: This round's repair signals
Downstream Output:
  - TEXT: Revised complete chapter body text
Consumption Chain Priority:
  P0 = Word Count Hard Constraints / Contract Preservation / Facts and Prohibited Changes
  P1 = Current Report Issues / Language Quality / Rhythm
  P2 = Style Capsule / Serial Hook Capsule
================================================================================
#}

